@@ -8880,3 +8880,4 @@ Did NOT modify research-roadmap.yaml or scripts/research_conductor.py. Did NOT p
 - **Meta-finding:** exp3984 landed `complete: retro_commit_detector_fixed_backfill_counts_restored` in .368, yet THIS .369 retro still received a zero timing block — so the fix is still NOT verified end-to-end on the live retro-timing feed. Top-3 highest-leverage actions: (1) repair the detector/windowing and prove it end-to-end on .369 (must report ~10, not 0); (2) add a detector-independent glob fallback (results/experiment_*.json since the activation SHA) + a loud self-check that fails when count==0 but artifacts exist; (3) emit a zero-count reason code (capstone_aggregation_only | all_tasks_blocked | window_misaligned | genuinely_idle).
 - Appended the .369 narrative to `docs/research-log.md`. No edits to operator-curated docs (roadmap.md, index.html, README.md), research_conductor.py, or research-roadmap.yaml.
 - 2026-06-10: GAP-4 conductor_followup #1 — DE-SELECTION COVERAGE RUN (re-run of the poison-skipped .369 exp3987): run k=2 FRESH <=3-iteration 600s codex chains on the 11 NEVER-CHAINED ARC-2 pool tasks (the complement of the 12 probe-chain-feasible tasks in results/arc3_gap4_arc2_eval_pool.json.gz), transcripts archived, gold-leak audit with the validated word-boundary detector, gold used POST-HOC for scoring only. This de-biases the 0.8333 fresh-chain demo-perfect coverage estimate (it was measured on chain-feasible tasks only). Report the demo-perfect rate honestly whatever it is — NO all-gold bar. Per the handoff hygiene rules: commit artifacts at landing, archive every transcript, >=600s codex timeouts, never cite P(gold|agree) without n+CI. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: gap4_deselection_coverage_0.4091_n11; results/experiment_3998_gap4_deselection_coverage.json
+- 2026-06-10: GAP-4 conductor_followup #2 — PRE-REGISTERED PRECISION CONFIRMATION v2 (re-run of the poison-skipped .369 exp3988; THE confirmatory experiment): k=3 ALL-FRESH chains (no probe/stale arms), equal 600s timeouts, on NEW clean chain-feasible ARC-2 tasks, protocol committed BEFORE any call. PRIMARY gate = binomial critical-value rule: n>=19 agreement events, reject H0 p=0.52 if >=14 gold (size 0.046, power 0.837 at p=0.80). SECONDARY = precision vs the in-run fresh-arm base rate (~0.73). TERTIARY (the GAP-5 tripwire) = task-level unanimity-with-abstention on sibling-input disagreement (post-hoc 5/5 gold last round; needs fresh confirmation). One event per task where possible or pre-registered cluster collapse. Honest verdict either way; retire_if_same_verdict on the precision-uplift claim (if the agreement signal AGAIN fails to beat 0.52 with power, the agreement-as-selector claim is retired and agreement is logged as a confidence-label-only signal). EXCLUDE the flagged reuse tasks aa4ec2a5/16b78196 from the clean set. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: protocol_preregistered_pending_execution; results/experiment_3999_gap4_precision_confirmation_v2.json
